{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54792","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占北斗，黄（辛本、川本、京本作「紫」）气在其中。\n吉（京本作「喜」，辛本、川本作「有」）事欲来君且记，不过旬日（京本作「逾三月」）喜重重，万姓贺尧风。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}